{"id":"P081-2","subject":"P","unit":"P081","unitTitle":"2025 ② (5월~8월) · 25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P081-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n다음과 같은 블록선도의 전달함수 는?               \n\n\n\n\n\n           ① \n           ② \n           ③ \n           ④ \n           ⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m26-q.webp","width":696,"height":1031},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m26-e1.webp","width":678,"height":710}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n주파수 전달함수가 인 시스템의 이득이 80\ndB일 때, 각주파수 rads는?\n\n\n① 25          ② 2.5\n\n③ 0.25         ④ 0.025\n\n⑤ 0.0025","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m27-q.webp","width":678,"height":647},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m27-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1172}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{