        ②                                          \n\n                      \n③            ④           \n\n      \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m30-q.webp","width":696,"height":1258},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m30-e1.webp","width":678,"height":683},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m30-e2.webp","width":696,"height":589}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n대지에 접지하는 이유로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 접지 저항이 작기 때문에\n\n② 전하가 외부로 방출되기 때문에\n\n③ 정전용량이 매우 크기 때문에\n\n④ 양전하 음전하가 무수히 많기 때문에\n\n⑤ 부피가 매우 크기 때문에","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m31-q.webp","width":696,"height":624},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m31-e1.webp","width":696,"height":620}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n유전율이 각각 Fm, Fm인 매질이 평행\n하게 접해있고, Cm이 30°의 입사각으로 경계\n면에 닿을 때, 전계