n①           ② \n\n                            \n③              ④ \n\n    \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m34","number":34},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m34-q.webp","width":678,"height":529},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m34-e1.webp","width":696,"height":636}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S2-Q10","number":10,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 35번","searchText":" 35\n\n자극의 세기가 × , 길이가 1m인 막대자석이\n평등자계 300Am 내에 자계의 방향과 수직으로 놓여\n\n있을 때, 막자자석에 작용하는 회전력N･m은?\n\n\n① 0.015        ② 0.03\n\n③ 0.06         ④ 0.15\n\n⑤ 0.3","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m35","number":35},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m35-q.webp","width":696,"height":647},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m35-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1246}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S2-Q11","number":11,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 36번","searchText":" 36\n\n비투자율이 801인 환상철심 내부의 평균자계의 세기가\n5000ATm일 때 자화의 세기m는?\n(단, × Hm이다.)\n\n\n①          ② \n\n③          ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m36","number":36},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m36-q.webp","width":696,"height":656},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m36-e1.webp","width":678,"height":731}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S2-Q12","number":12,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 37번","searchText":" 37\n\n22kW, 110V의 직류 분권 발전기가 있다.\n\n전기자 권선의 저항이 0.05Ω일 때, 전압변동률은?\n\n(단, 소수점 3자리 이하는 절사한다.)\n\n\n① 7.45         ② 8.14\n\n③ 9.09         ④ 9.65\n\n⑤ 10.12","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m37","number":37},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m37-q.webp","width":696,"height":580},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m37-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1151},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m37-e2.webp","width":696,"height":948}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S2-Q13","number":13,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 38번","searchText":" 38\n\n최근 전동기는 B종 절연과 F종 절연을 많이 사용한다.\n\nB종 절연물과 F종 절연물의 최고 허용온도°C의 차이는?\n\n\n① 10          ② 15\n\n③ 20          ④ 25\n\n⑤ 30","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m38","number":38},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m38-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m38-e1.webp","width":696,"height":655}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S2-Q14","number":14,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 39번","searchText":" 39\n\n동기 발전기의 고정자의 자계와 회전자의 자계가 동기속도\n\n로 회전하고 있다. 고정자의 자계와 회전자의 자계 사이의\n\n각을 무엇이라 하는가?\n\n\n① 역률각        ② 부하각\n\n③ 소호각        ④ 회전각\n\n⑤ 굴절각","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m39","number":39},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m39-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m39-e1.webp","width":696,"height":282}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S2-Q15","number":15,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 40번","searchText":" 40\n\n동기 발전기의 전기자 전류가 다음과 같은 방향으로 흐를\n\n때, 동기 발전기에서 나타나는 전기자 반작용은?\n\n(단, 는 계자 자속 방향, 는 전기자 자속 방향이다.)\n\n\n\n\n\n① 교차자화작용     ② 횡축반작용\n\n③ 증자작용       ④ 감자작용\n\n⑤ 자기유도작용","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m40","number":40},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m40-q.webp","width":678,"height":757},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m40-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1117}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S2-Q16","number":16,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 41번","searchText":" 41\n\n5000/200V, 20kVA의 단상변압기의 2차측이 단락이\n\n되었을 때 단락전류가 100A 였다. 이 경우에 1차측 전압\n\n이 300V라면, 변압기의 %임피던스 강하는?\n\n\n① 10          ② 8\n\n③ 6           ④ 4\n\n② 2","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m41","number":41},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m41-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m41-e1.webp","width":678,"height":765},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m41-e2.webp","width":696,"height":541}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S2-Q17","number":17,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 42번","searchText":" 42\n\n단상 변압기의 이 2.5, 가 5, cos\n\n일 때, 전압변동률은?\n\n\n① 2           ② 3\n\n③ 4           ④ 5\n\n⑤ 6","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m42","number":42},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m42-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m42-e1.webp","width":696,"height":831}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S2-Q18","number":18,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 43번","searchText":" 43\n\n유도전동기에 연결된 인버터 장치의 주파수를 증가시킬 때\n\n나타나는 현상은?\n\n\n① 전동기의 자속이 증가한다.\n\n② 전동기의 기동전류가 증가한다.\n\n③ 전동기의 회전속도가 증가한다.\n\n④ 전동기의 내부온도가 상승한다.\n\n⑤ 전동기의 토크가 증가한다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m43","number":43},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m43-q.webp","width":696,"height":637},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m43-e1.webp","width":696,"height":513}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S2-Q19","number":19,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 44번","searchText":" 44\n\n4극 60Hz 3상 유도전동기의 회전속도가 1692rpm일\n\n때, 회전자의 주파수Hz는?\n\n\n① 1.8          ② 2.4\n\n③ 5.4          ④ 3.2\n\n⑤ 3.6","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m44","number":44},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m44-q.webp","width":678,"height":443},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m44-e1.webp","width":678,"height":465}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S2-Q20","number":20,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 45번","searchText":" 45\n\n다이오드 브리지 정류회로의 리플을 줄이는 방법으로 옳은\n\n것은?\n\n\n① 커패시터를 병렬로 연결한다.\n\n② 커패시터의 용량을 작게한다\n\n③ 인덕터를 병렬로 연결한다.\n\n④ 스위칭 주파수를 크게한다.\n\n⑤ 한 개의 정류기를 사용한다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m45","number":45},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m45-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m45-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1416}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S2-Q21","number":21,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 46번","searchText":" 46\n\n\nPWM(Pulse Width Modulation)방식에서 듀티비를\n\n증가시킬 때, 출력전압은 어떻게 되는가?\n\n\n① 출력전압이 증가한다.\n\n② 출력전압이 감소한다.\n\n③ 출력전압이 일정적으로 나타난다.\n\n④ 출력전압이 불안정적으로 변한다.\n\n⑤ 출력전압이 듀티비와 관계없이 일정하게 유지된다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m46","number":46},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m46-q.webp","width":678,"height":524},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m46-e1.webp","width":696,"height":709}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S2-Q22","number":22,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 47번","searchText":" 47\n\nDC-AC 변환회로에서 SPWM(Sinusoidal Pulse Width\n\nModulation)를 사용하면 발생하는 결과는?\n\n\n① 출력전압이 상승한다.\n\n② 출력전압의 고조파 및 왜곡이 제거된다.\n\n③ 출력전압의 변화는 없다.\n\n④ 출력전압이 불안정하게 변동된다.\n\n⑤ 출력전압을 평탄하게 한다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m47","number":47},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m47-q.webp","width":678,"height":394},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m47-e1.webp","width":696,"height":628}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S2-Q23","number":23,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 48번","searchText":" 48\n\n다음 그림과 같이 OP-Amp 2개를 연결했을 때, 이득 \n\n이 100인 경우, 회로의 총 전압이득이 180dB이었다.\n\n이 경우 이득 는?\n\n\n\n\n\n①           ② \n③           ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m48","number":48},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m48-q.webp","width":696,"height":762},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m48-e1.webp","width":696,"height":546},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m48-e2.webp","width":678,"height":536}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S2-Q24","number":24,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 49번","searchText":" 49\n\nPLL의 주요 구성요소가 아닌 것은?\n\n\n① 위상 비교기      ② 루프필터\n\n③ 전압제어 발진기(VCO) ④ 출력 증폭기\n\n⑤ 피드백 회로","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m49","number":49},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m49-q.webp","width":696,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m49-e1.webp","width":678,"height":936}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S2-Q25","number":25,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 50번","searchText":" 50\n\n파라미터에서 이 의미하는 것은?\n\n\n① 전류이득       ② 전압이득\n\n③ 전달 임피던스     ④ 전달 어드미턴스\n\n⑤ 출력전압","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m50","number":50},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m50-q.webp","width":696,"height":598},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m50-e1.webp","width":678,"height":413},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m50-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1883}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]}]}
